    "Allow patterns, one per line — Bash(npm test:*), Bash(git *), mcp__github__* (an MCP server), mcp__github__get_issue (one tool), WebFetch(domain:docs.spring.io), WebSearch. Matching calls never ask. Applies live.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Allow patterns, one per line — Bash(npm test:*), Bash(git *), mcp__github__* (an MCP server), mcp__github__get_issue (one tool), WebFetch(domain:docs.spring.io), WebSearch. Matching calls never ask. Applies live."
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "한 줄에 하나씩 — Bash(npm test:*), Bash(git *), mcp__github__* (MCP 서버 전체), mcp__github__get_issue (도구 하나), WebFetch(domain:docs.spring.io), WebSearch. 일치하는 호출은 묻지 않습니다. 즉시 적용됩니다."
          }
        }
      }
