          }
        }
      }
    },
    "As in the terminal: Claude can run a command in the background (a dev server, a long build) and /loop can repeat a prompt. When a background command ends or a scheduled run starts, Claude goes on by itself — that turn is reviewed like any other, and files a background command changed in between go into the next review. Takes effect when the session restarts.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "As in the terminal: Claude can run a command in the background (a dev server, a long build) and /loop can repeat a prompt. When a background command ends or a scheduled run starts, Claude goes on by itself — that turn is reviewed like any other, and files a background command changed in between go into the next review. Takes effect when the session restarts."
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "터미널처럼 Claude가 명령을 백그라운드로 돌리고(dev 서버, 긴 빌드) /loop로 같은 요청을 반복할 수 있어요. 백그라운드 명령이 끝나거나 예약 실행이 시작되면 Claude가 이어서 작업하고, 그 턴도 다른 턴처럼 리뷰해요. 그사이 백그라운드 명령이 바꾼 파일은 다음 리뷰에 들어가요. 세션을 다시 시작하면 적용돼요."
          }
        }
      }
    },
