    "Paste it in Terminal. Don't open this chat in ReviewGate while it runs there — two Claude processes on one conversation would corrupt it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Paste it in Terminal. Don't open this chat in ReviewGate while it runs there — two Claude processes on one conversation would corrupt it."
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "터미널에 붙여 넣으세요. 터미널에서 돌고 있는 동안에는 ReviewGate에서 이 채팅을 열지 마세요 — 한 대화를 Claude 프로세스 두 개가 쓰면 기록이 망가져요."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Paste it in Terminal. This chat is open here too: start a new chat in ReviewGate first — two Claude processes on one conversation would corrupt it.": {
