    "Starts a new Claude session once when the current one dies unexpectedly. The review list is kept either way; off, the chat shows \"Session ended — Restart\".": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Starts a new Claude session once when the current one dies unexpectedly. The review list is kept either way; off, the chat shows \"Session ended — Restart\"."
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "현재 세션이 예기치 않게 종료되면 새 Claude 세션을 한 번 시작합니다. 리뷰 목록은 어느 쪽이든 유지되며, 끄면 채팅에 \"세션 종료됨 — 재시작\"이 표시됩니다."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Starts the task in a workbench of its own — a new branch and folder, its own window and a fresh chat — so this chat is left as it is.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Starts the task in a workbench of its own — a new branch and folder, its own window and a fresh chat — so this chat is left as it is."
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "업무를 전용 워크벤치(새 브랜치와 폴더, 자기 창과 새 채팅)에서 시작해요. 지금 채팅은 그대로 남아요."
          }
        }
      }
    },
